Scoped Sony OpenMG (OMA) LPCM demuxer

The EA3 probe and 96-byte header checks, the eid encryption rule, the codec-id
routing, the LPCM stream parameters and the 1024-byte packet and byte-position
pts semantics in src/oma.ts follow libavformat/omadec.c (oma_read_probe,
oma_read_header, read_packet), oma.c (ff_oma_codec_tags), oma.h and id3v2.c
(ff_id3v2_match).
